{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">旺角有商舖被淋紅油，2人被捕。<br/></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.DAMAGE.MK-0430.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026h6Q82Pv4qz1787520956.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.DAMAGE.MK-0430.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">凌晨二時許，警方接報指旺角中心一期有地舖表行被淋紅油。警方調查後拘捕兩名男子，列刑事毀壞案處理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T21:55:38.466256+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":64,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}